msgid "Camera sensor"
msgstr "Датчик камери"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-pure-thermal.rst:232
msgid ""
"The OV5640 is the primary CSI on the Pure Thermal — pass ``cid=csi.OV5640`` "
